      "text": "ROS — any problems with:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " frequent headaches or dizziness; fainting; eyes or vision; ears or hearing; nose or throat; breathing problems or chest pain; belly pain, vomiting, bowel problems; painful urination or other urine problems; rashes, moles, sunburn; muscle aches, injury or other problems; fatigue. Girls: first period yet; last period; problems with periods; vaginal itching, burning or discharge."
